      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T21:45:40Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "In the new implementation, arrays of dense types that don\u0027t undergo type conversion are able to be copied in their entirety. In particular, this means a 4x4 matrix is 1 16-element write instead of 4 4-element writes, and arrays of vec4s (e.g. for gradients) are a single memcpy.",
